# A reload over the same files: the nodes unregistered and registered again with their echoes, every alert REMOVED
# and linked again with its id, the log's older entries marked as replaced, the store's rows, the passes after it.
database real
queue 1
health-dirs tests/corpus/reload/v1.d -
rules tests/corpus/reload/v1.d/a.conf
chart loop.r loop.r_name loop.reload disks things 1
var loop.r v 70
register
clock 0
pass 0
store
clock 1
pass 1
store
clock 2
reload
store
clock 3
pass 3
store
clock 4
pass 4
store
